<title>UK: EIB sets 150 million Swiss franc Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 150 million Swiss franc Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE  S-15.MAY.02</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
